# 畫面文字（canvas）。鍵名為「canvas-」加上取自英文的簡短名稱，工具提示的鍵名以 -tip 結尾。

canvas-canvas-is-larger-than-the = 畫布超過 GPU 的紋理大小上限
canvas-gpu-initialization-failed = GPU 初始化失敗
canvas-gpu-compositing-failed = GPU 合成失敗
canvas-gpu-turned-off-in-the = 已在設定中關閉 GPU
canvas-no-gpu-found = 找不到 GPU
canvas-software-gpu-adapter = 這是軟體模擬的 GPU
canvas-the-gpu-lacks-the-needed = GPU 缺少所需的功能
canvas-unknown-channel = 專案中沒有此通道
canvas-groups-are-nested-too-deeply = 群組巢狀層數過深，無法在 GPU 上合成
canvas-over-the-gpu-memory-budget = 超過 GPU 記憶體上限
canvas-read-only-tip = 唯讀
canvas-the-view-is-rotated-click-tip = 檢視已旋轉（{ $angle }）。按一下即可重設旋轉
canvas-mesh-map-tip = 網格貼圖
canvas-stroke-cancelled = 已取消筆畫。
canvas-the-view-is-mirrored-click-tip = 檢視已左右翻轉。按一下即可還原
canvas-outside-the-canvas = 在畫布之外。
canvas-clone-source-set = 已設定仿製來源。
canvas-layer-set-not-in-the-output = 顯示中的圖層集未包含在最終輸出中
